{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Negative Energy is a tower defense game with basic RTS mechanics, where your goal is to defend the construction of a Dyson sphere until it ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build ships, assign them to fleets and strategically move them within the perimeter of the star system to intercept and destroy enemy fleets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Note:</u></strong><u> Some game mechanics are not yet listed here. Please refer to the Early Access Section to view all the upcoming implementations, that may or may not be already\u00a0 implemented.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build ships and assign them to fleets;<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002720/extras/Feature_Artwork_01_-_Build_Dialog.gif?t=1744915282\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan fleets timing and intercept positions in the most efficient way to counter enemy attacks;<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002720/extras/Feature_Artwork_02_-_Intercept_Enemy_Fleet.gif?t=1744915282\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack and move your ships to gain the initiative;<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002720/extras/Feature_Artwork_03_-_Move_Ships.gif?t=1744915282\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reassign ships to another fleets;<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002720/extras/Feature_Artwork_04_-_Reassign_Ships.gif?t=1744915282\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage and gather the available resources to build better ships;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pause the game at any given time;</p></li><